      "revision": 1352596559,
      "text": "Neolitsea cassia is a species of flowering plant in the family Lauraceae. It is known as \"dawulu kurundu - දවුල් කුරුදු\" or \"kudu dawula - කුඩු දවුල\" in Sinhala. It is a shrub or tree native to India, Sri Lanka, and the northern Andaman Islands."
    }
